msgid "Archived:Loading ChibiOS firmware onto Pixhawk"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:9
#: 446dd900949c439a8eae810e986722fa
msgid "These instructions explain how to download and install the beta ArduPilot with ChibiOS firmware onto a pixhawk autopilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:11
#: 2f137f65624341f7a8b99878d25abe12
msgid "In tests the development team has found using ChibiOS (in place of NuttX) results in a smaller firmware with faster loop rates and less timing jitter. ChibiOS builds have less testing and a few `missing features <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/8109>`__ however."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:14
#: 49c4fc23a81c40c792c6de3262b40dd7
msgid "Parameters are preserved when moving between ChibiOS and NuttX firmwares and no re-tuning of the vehicle should be required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:17
#: f9ab1251f3064af7b3822f04dc042622
msgid "Downloading the beta firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:19
#: e8491887f40a48b493c47b14c21bf95b
msgid "Download the appropriate beta firmware from `firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ using the links below and save the resulting .apj file somewhere on your PC:"
msgstr ""

